            "toc_label": "Chlorine",
            "anchor": "chlorine",
            "text": "<p>US water utilities add chlorine or chloramine to keep tap water safe to drink. In a hot shower, that chlorine reaches your skin, your scalp and the steam you breathe.</p><p>A showerhead filter helps reduce free chlorine right where you use the water, for a more comfortable shower.</p>"
