            "toc_label": "Hard water",
            "anchor": "hard-water",
            "text": "<p>Hard water carries dissolved calcium and magnesium. They leave limescale on glass and chrome, and a similar film on hair and skin. Soap rinses less cleanly, hair can look dull, and skin can feel coated.</p>"
